    "summary": "As [your Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) ends, pick an enemy unit up to 18\" from this model and [visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) to it. Whenever an **AELDARI** model of yours attacks that enemy unit, the attack gets +1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls), until [your next Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase). No unit can be picked for this ability more than once per turn.",
